<title>UK: BAe concludes AGM despite protests.</title>
<headline>BAe concludes AGM despite protests.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>British Aerospace Plc successfully concluded its annual meeting of shareholders on Wednesday after negotiating a barrage of questions from anti-arms protesters.</p>
<p>The meeting lasted nearly three hours.</p>
<p>More than 120 protesters had to be escorted or carried out of the meeting before proceedings could begin.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
